<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij wins Swedish clean-up order.</title>
<headline>Heidemij wins Swedish clean-up order.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering consultancy firm Heidemij said on Monday it had won an order for an environmental clean-up operation in Sweden with its Swedish partner AB Gotthard Nilsson.</p>
<p>No financial details were given, but Heidemij said the order involved the purification of 25,000 tonnes of soil.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
